  UI -->|REST /api/*| N
  UI -->|WS /ws| N

  N -->|/api/*| API
  N -->|/ws| API
  N -->|non-/api fallback| UI

  API -->|read/write| DB
  API -->|tail| LOG
  API -->|poll| AKILE
  API -->|broadcast| WS
  SCHED -->|scheduled async jobs| API

  note1[Docs moved under /api to avoid SPA fallback]
  note2[Logs are a first-class admin API for live debugging]
